sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 20vw, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 50vw\" src=\"/reference/2a996c2dbe88-image\"></div><h3 class=\"text-module__DYGPWq__root text-module__DYGPWq__headline-large text-module__DYGPWq__weight-medium person-card-module__7PXqzG__name\"><span class=\"person-card-module__7PXqzG__nameLine\">Arash</span><span class=\"person-card-module__7PXqzG__nameLine person-card-module__7PXqzG__nameLineStaggered\">Saidi</span></h3><p class=\"text-module__DYGPWq__root text-module__DYGPWq__body-large\">Chief Executive Officer</p><p class=\"text-module__DYGPWq__root text-module__DYGPWq__body-large text-module__DYGPWq__color-foreground-50 person-card-module__7PXqzG__phoneBio\">Arash Saidi is the Chief Executive Officer of Cypher Capital, a multi-asset investment manager investing across digital assets, AI infrastructure and private equity. He leads the firm's expansion beyond its digital asset foundations into a multi-asset platform - spanning the Digital Multi-Strategy Fund, institutional access to AI infrastructure opportunities developed by the group's affiliate, Storm Group, and differentiated private equity investments targeting the technologies reshaping the real economy, led by artificial intelligence and robotics.</p></a></div></div></li><li class=\"team-group-module__ZaaMEW__cell\"><div class=\"person-card-module__7PXqzG__root\"><span class=\"person-card-module__7PXqzG__rule\"></span><div class=\"reveal-module__nuDBzW__root reveal-module__nuDBzW__wipe person-card-module__7PXqzG__card person-card-module__7PXqzG__animated\" style=\"--stagger:3\"><a class=\"person-card-module__7PXqzG__link\" href=\"/leadership/kim-wong\"><div class=\"person-card-module__7PXqzG__photo\"><img alt=\"Kim Wong\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"person-card-module__7PXqzG__image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 20vw, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 50vw\" src=\"/referen